10
00:51:06,666 --> 00:51:12,666
A Cinderella Story: If the Shoe Fits is a 2016 American musical teen comedy directed by Michelle
Johnston (in her directorial debut) and starring Sofia Carson, Thomas Law and Jennifer Tilly.

11
00:56:13,333 --> 00:56:19,333
It is the fourth installment in the A Cinderella Story series.

12
01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,000
The film was released digitally on August 2,
2016, and on DVD on August 16, 2016.

13
01:06:26,666 --> 01:06:32,666
It premiered on Freeform on November 27, 2016 with
1.11 million viewers tuning in.

14
01:11:33,333 --> 01:11:39,333
It also aired on Disney Channel on January 16, 2017 and
was watched by 2.13 million viewers.

15
01:16:40,000 --> 01:16:46,000
It was followed by A Cinderella Story: Christmas Wish in 2019.

16
01:21:46,666 --> 01:21:52,666
The film explores themes of dance, dancer, fairy tale, musical, celebrity.

17
01:26:53,333 --> 01:26:59,333
The tone is lighthearted.
